    "content": "$x^{2} - 3x + 2 = 0$",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: $x(3 - x) = 2$, so $3x - x^{2} = 2$, i.e. $x^{2} - 3x + 2 = 0$."
   }
  ],
